# Step 12: Request Lifecycle

Suppose the browser sends

```
GET /users/5
```

Flow:

```
Browser
    │
    ▼
Uvicorn
    │
    ▼
Starlette Application
    │
    ▼
Routing
    │
    ▼
Middleware
    │
    ▼
FastAPI
    │
    ├── Validate parameters
    ├── Dependency Injection
    ├── Parse Body
    ├── Pydantic Validation
    │
    ▼
Your Endpoint
    │
    ▼
Return dict
    │
    ▼
FastAPI serializes it
    │
    ▼
Starlette Response
    │
    ▼
Browser
```

